# Generated data and results
#
# data/processed/, results/figures/, results/tables/ and results/reports/ hold
# generated output. Only the canonical HydroKG software/data release artifacts
# are trackable; the negations below are enumerated per file from
# docs/public_tree_proposal_v1.md so that no historical or exploratory output
# becomes trackable and no required release artifact can silently disappear
# from the repository. Manuscript, Supporting Information, and publication
# figure/table assets intentionally have no negations and stay untracked.
data/processed/*
!data/processed/README.md
!data/processed/hydrokg_edges.csv
!data/processed/hydrokg_nodes.csv
!data/processed/hydrokg_r_centered_device_table.csv
results/figures/*
results/tables/*
!results/tables/README.md
!results/tables/data_validation_summary.csv
!results/tables/hydrokg_device_pathway_matches.csv
!results/tables/hydrokg_device_reporting_completeness.csv
!results/tables/hydrokg_device_rule_evidence.csv
!results/tables/hydrokg_edge_type_counts.csv
!results/tables/hydrokg_edge_type_degree_summary.csv
!results/tables/hydrokg_graph_integrity_summary.csv
!results/tables/hydrokg_integrated_edges.csv
!results/tables/hydrokg_integrated_nodes.csv
!results/tables/hydrokg_low_r_high_power_concept_counts.csv
!results/tables/hydrokg_low_r_high_power_devices.csv
